{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">一名46歲男子，懷疑持刀在牛頭角遊蕩，警方在彩虹邨附近將他拘捕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">據了解，警方下午約一時接報，指一名男子懷疑持刀，在牛頭角啟業邨一個街市遊蕩，之後離去。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.KNIFE-2330_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20266Ar8qQ8nzh1791387442.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.KNIFE-2330_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">警方翻查包括「銳眼計劃」下的閉路電視片段，發現該名男子在旺角登上一輛巴士1A，之後警方在太子道東近彩虹邨對開，截停巴士並找到該男子，並在他的斜孭袋中，檢獲一把約32厘米長的刀，以涉嫌藏有攻擊性武器拘捕他，正扣留調查。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.KNIFE-2330_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Gh2Nl5n3i01791387453.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.KNIFE-2330_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T19:59:01.327312+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":185,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}